plugin-qualify (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.12.0: instruments measured with notes
  * classifier: judge an instrument as an instrument host plays it
  * probe judge: an LV2 instrument's verdict reads its note sweep
  * lv2_measure: play an LV2 instrument through its MIDI input
  * measurement format 1.5: the note sweep an instrument was counted under
  * cost: an instrument with an audio input is timed holding notes too
  * README: how an instrument's cost is taken
  * clap-qualify: keep what a plugin prints out of the lines
  * clap-qualify: sweep a stepped parameter over its whole values
  * clap-qualify: send all notes off as the host sends it
  * qualification record: an instrument's cost row says the notes it held
  * benchmark: time an LV2 instrument holding --probe-notes notes
  * clap-qualify: time an instrument at every rate with notes held
  * measurement format 1.4: the notes an instrument's cost was taken with

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 02:20:39 +0000
